break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そして私は"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今回も選抜入れませんでした。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まず みさが入っていると"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"信じてくれていた方"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ガッカリされたと思います。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まだまだみさは"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"期待には答えられませんでした。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"選抜発表のあった日に"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ブログを書いていたんですが"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"オンエアを見たら 色んな気持ち"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"出てきて全部書き直しました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"文がぐちゃぐちゃかもしれません。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ん～。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"頑張っても頑張っても"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ずっとアンダーなのかな。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"アンダーのお姉さんなのかな。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"乃木坂に居ていいのかな。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"これは選抜発表の夜に"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"書いたメモです。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"一週間たって、少し落ち着いて"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"気持ちも変わりました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"正直、もう、何をどう頑張れば"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"選抜に入れるのかは"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"一週間たっても変わらず"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"やっぱり分かりません。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"でも、ファンのみなさん。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みさ、 やれることは"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"全力でやったんです。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"レッスン、イベント、お仕事"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"目の前のこと一つずつ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"自分なりに努力しました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そして、それはきっと"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みさが言わなくても"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みなさんは見てくれていて"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"知ってくれていると思います。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"だから今回こんな結果だけど"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"悔しいのに変わりはないけど"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"後悔はしていません。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そして やっぱり一度決めた事は"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"最後までやり遂げたい。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"乃木坂46のメンバーとして"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"オーディションに合格して"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"素敵な仲間と 暖かいファンの"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みなさんに出逢えて"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"色々思い出しても、やっぱり"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"私は乃木坂が大好きで"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ここで色んなことを学びたい。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"他のどこでもない。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"その事に変わりはありません！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いい事も悪い事も"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"嬉しいことも辛いことも"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"たくさん学んで ちゃんと"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"自分の力にしていきたい。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"『すぐに結果が出ないから』"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"途中で逃げ出す事は"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いくらでもできます。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"でも、そこで諦めるような"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"生き方は私はしたくありません。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"叶えたい夢があるから。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"やっぱり歌いたい、もっと。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今は乃木坂ではアンダーで"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"なかなか披露できる"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"機会も少ないけれど。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ゆっくり、ゆっくり"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ちょっとずつ、自分の夢に"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"近づけていると思います。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いろんな物を捨て"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"覚悟を決めて 去年の春"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"1人で上京してきました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"生半可な気持ちではありません。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"何があっても味方でいて"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"私の幸せを願う家族が居て"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"どんなときも励まし合う"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"共に頑張る 仲間が居て"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そしてみさがどんな状況でも"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"夢を応援してくれる"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"支えてくださる みなさんが居て。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"本当は、それだけで幸せです。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"周りにどれだけ支えられて"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"生きているか。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"本当に感謝の気持ちで"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いっぱいです。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"でもやっぱり"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今のままじゃ嫌だ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"もっと上を目指したい。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"見たことない自分に出会いたい。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"きっとね"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みさは 花が満開に咲くには"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"時